  "details": "Same bug as this old canny.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/sdk-bug-reports/p/onownershiptransfer-triger-fires-when-any-ownership-transfer-happend\nWhenever any object ownership transfer happens, every object with OnOwnershipTransfer trigger will fire for everyone in the world.\nTest world:\nwrld_bda2500a-28fa-489b-a080-7331db9473ea\nThere are 4 triggers with OnTransferOwnership and each will activate a green orb showing when the trigger fires.\n- No object sync, just the trigger.\n- Pickup with no object sync\n- Pickup with object sync\n- Object sync and trigger only\nHave a players take turns picking up the pickup with sync. \nObserved results:\nWhen a player takes ownership, all OnOwnershipTransfer triggers fire, causing all the orbs to show green for all players.\nExpected results:\nOnly the OnOwnershipTransfer for the pickup that changed ownership should fire for all players.",
